    "enUS": {
      "description": "You will have to forgive me for sending you on such a series of tasks without providing any context. I hadn't considered how suspicious this may have seemed, more so now that the skies have taken on such a dramatic appearance.\r\n\r\nI will gladly answer your questions.",
      "objectiveLines": [
